<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Fallen Legion Guard -->
  <OE_Mech_LegionGuard.label>堕落军团守卫</OE_Mech_LegionGuard.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultra-tech and ultra-armored medium-sized mechanoid with a built-in mech gestator. Fed with appropriate resources, the Fallen Legion Guard can form small Fallen Legion Drones combat mechs. Fallen Legion Guard are deployable combat mechanoid usually manufactured inside an ultra-tech Fallen Legion mech. They are mounted with non-rechargeable power source.\n\nUses specially designed gun-spear Fallen Legion Guard Spear. -->
  <OE_Mech_LegionGuard.description>一种超科技、超装甲的中等体型机械体，内置机械培育器。通过适当的资源供给，堕落军团守卫可以形成小型堕落军团无人机战斗机械体。堕落军团守卫是可部署的战斗机械体，通常在超科技堕落军团机械体内制造。它们配备了不可充电的电源。\n\n使用特别设计的枪矛堕落军团守卫长矛。</OE_Mech_LegionGuard.description>
  <!-- EN: left fist -->
  <OE_Mech_LegionGuard.tools.left_fist.label>左拳</OE_Mech_LegionGuard.tools.left_fist.label>
